      "id": "numbas-q94124-numbas-8ecc2008",
      "title": "Matrix addition",
      "imported": {
        "format": "numbas",
        "changes": [
          "PhysLab added a picture (Numbas gave none): the first columns of A and B as arrows from the same point; their sum, the first column of A + B, is left for the student to work out.",
