    {
      "id": "numbas-q94128-numbas-81208a40",
      "title": "Matrix subtraction",
      "imported": {
        "format": "numbas",
        "changes": [
          "PhysLab added a picture (Numbas gave none): the first columns of A and B as arrows from the same point; their difference, the first column of A − B, is left for the student to work out.",
          "Marked exactly, as Numbas marks it: a whole-number answer no longer carries a 2 % band that let an answer one out pass as right.",
          "The step 'Please see lecture slides for worked example' (another course's) is replaced by a worked first entry."
