          "The cheetah's catch-up time is corrected to 50/21 ≈ 2.38 s (31t = 10t + 50); the original's 2.35 was the middle of its accepted range, not the answer.",
          "'3·2 lots of t' in the equation in s now reads '3·2 lots of s'.",
